In article <1992Mar11.140213.11712@bhpcpd.kembla.oz.au> dif@bhpcpd.kembla.oz.au (David Faulkner) writes:
>A similar thing happened to me recently. I wished for a "blessed magic
>marker" and got given a cursed magic marker (99). How can this happen?

Stuff like this happens when your God is pissed off at you. An angry
god can make a wish for a blessed +3 weapon result in a cursed -3
weapon. An addition, if you luck is negative, you have a chance for a
wish not to work at all, i.e. you zap your WoW and get a message like
"Unfortunetly, nothing happens", and you lose your wish. Real
annoying. Moral, keep in good standing with your God at all times.

